ANBU SURVEILLANCE SUMMARY
Prepared for: Hokage's Office
Classification: Restricted — Jonin+ / ANBU

Reporting period: current cycle. Consolidated from field cell reports.

Border and Interior Observations:
1. Fire Country northern border — routine. Two unregistered travelers
   detained and cleared; no shinobi affiliation confirmed.
2. Interior — an itinerant merchant caravan flagged for repeat presence
   near the village gate placed under passive watch. No hostile intent
   observed.
3. Cross-village — increased courier traffic between minor villages;
   assessed as ordinary trade, monitoring continued.

Threat Notes: No confirmed Akatsuki incursion this period. Sensor teams
report faint chakra signatures on the eastern ridge, unresolved. A
follow-up sweep is tasked.

Recommendation: Maintain standing gate protocol; continue passive watch
on the flagged caravan. Submitted by ANBU cell lead.
